      "text": "简单的一句问候语：\n你好，我是 XXXX，\n我能 XXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
      "fontSize": 11.949521105751307,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "简单的一句问候语：\n你好，我是 XXXX，\n我能 XXXXXXXXXXXXXXX",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vwuug1ivo8Sllgp778kvV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960.59335173603,
      "y": 46.80789977411362,
      "width": 434.7547607421875,
      "height": 79.1752720757239,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1719976471,
      "version": 885,
      "versionNonce": 956601470,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789223431667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "问候语采用 Redis 缓存，MySql 持久化存储\n每隔半天就会通过定时任务去刷新一次问候语，\n如果 Redis 不存在则查询之前的上一次问候语，如果也不存在\n则返回固定模板语句",
      "fontSize": 15.835054415144779,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "问候语采用 Redis 缓存，MySql 持久化存储\n每隔半天就会通过定时任务去刷新一次问候语，\n如果 Redis 不存在则查询之前的上一次问候语，如果也不存在\n则返回固定模板语句",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
